{"id":"b13ec70aec8d64a6","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-comparison-function.md","title":"Comparison (Less-or-Equal) Function","display":"df-comparison-function — Comparison (Less-or-Equal) Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-comparison-function","aliases":["90-df-comparison-function","90-df-leq"],"display":"df-comparison-function — Comparison (Less-or-Equal) Function","depends_on":["[[90-df-subtraction-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-comparison-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-comparison-function</span><span>90-df-leq</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-comparison-function — Comparison (Less-or-Equal) Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1e6602d1acf4aceb\" href=\"?note=1e6602d1acf4aceb\" title=\"90-df-subtraction-function\">90-df-subtraction-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-comparison-function-—-Comparison-Function-$\\mathrm{leq}$\">df-comparison-function — Comparison Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{leq}\">\\(\\mathrm{leq}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{sub} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{sub} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (截断减法, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1e6602d1acf4aceb\" href=\"?note=1e6602d1acf4aceb\" title=\"90-df-subtraction-function\">90-df-subtraction-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{leq} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{leq} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (comparison function, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comparison\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\forall x,y \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{leq}(x,y) \\coloneqq \\begin{cases}1 &amp; \\mathrm{sub}(x,y)=0,\\\\0 &amp; \\mathrm{sub}(x,y)&gt;0.\\end{cases}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comparison\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\forall x,y \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{leq}(x,y) \\coloneqq \\begin{cases}1 &amp; \\mathrm{sub}(x,y)=0,\\\\0 &amp; \\mathrm{sub}(x,y)&gt;0.\\end{cases}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{leq}(x, y) = 1\">\\(\\mathrm{leq}(x, y) = 1\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\leq y\">\\(x \\leq y\\)</span>，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span></li>\n<li>该定义是截断减法的零检验：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\leq y \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{sub}(x,y)=0\">\\(x \\leq y \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{sub}(x,y)=0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a> — 原始递归函数类</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a> — 原始递归算子</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e6602d1acf4aceb\" href=\"?note=1e6602d1acf4aceb\" title=\"90-df-subtraction-function\">90-df-subtraction-function</a> — 截断减法</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"220648f3ca864e2c\" href=\"?note=220648f3ca864e2c\" title=\"90-df-addition-function\">90-df-addition-function</a> — 加法函数</li>\n</ul>\n","